WHAT THIS MEANS IN PRACTICE
---------------------------

Piggyback is a framework meant to be built on. Using it as a dependency of your
own mod needs no permission, including in a published mod. A credit and a link
back are appreciated but not required for that.

If you modify the source, or ship a modified version:

1. ATTRIBUTION. You credit Piggyback and Kroosstiich in your mod's description
   or documentation. A dependency on the original Nexus page is NOT required,
   since depending on what you change it could cause more problems than it
   solves.

2. NON-COMMERCIAL. You may not use Piggyback, or anything derived from it, for
   commercial purposes. It may not be sold, put behind a paywall, bundled into
   anything paid, or used to gate access to paid content.

3. COPYRIGHT. Copyright stays with me. This licence grants permission to use the
   work; it does not transfer ownership of it.

If your change fixes or improves something, please consider opening a pull
request rather than maintaining a permanent fork, so the framework does not
fragment into incompatible copies.

Do not re-upload the plugin as-is, or a re-upload of it, under another name.


